msgid "Legacy PS-Poll"
msgstr "传统 PS-Poll"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid ""
"A client showing Legacy PS-Poll is dozing between beacons. That state is "
"not visible in retry or drop counters, which stay at zero even when the "
"link is stalling."
msgstr ""
"显示\"传统 PS-Poll\"的客户端正在信标之间休眠。该状态在重传或丢包计数器中不可见——"
"即使链路已经卡死，这些计数器仍可能保持为零。"
